<h3><u>Sughra ko rulata hai</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Sughra ko rulat hai, ye chaand muharram ka) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Jab sam-e ne aata hai) x2 Ye chand-e muharram ka</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Sughra ko rulat hai, ye chaand muharram ka) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Ham surate zehra se, bhayi ki bicharne ki. Khatune kayamat-e ki (Gar baar ujar ne ki) x2 Rudaade sunata hai, ye chaand muharram ka</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Sughra ko rulat hai, ye chaand muharram ka) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Kata hai gala logo, sehroz ke pyaase ka. Pamaal huwa lasha (Ahmed ke nawase ka) x2 Har ek ko batataa. ye chaand muharram ka</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Sughra ko rulat hai, ye chaand muharram ka) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Taswir dikhata hai, Ahmed ke jawane ka. Har shaks ko duniya me (Karbal ki kahani ki) x2 Tafsir batataa hai, ye chaand muharram ka</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Sughra ko rulat hai, ye chaand muharram ka) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Karbal ki ziyarat-e ko, jo ankh tarap ti thi. Shabbir tere gham me (Jo ankh barasti thi) x2 Us ankh ko bhataa hai, ye chaand muharram ka</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Sughra ko rulat hai, ye chaand muharram ka) x2</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;""><br></span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">Imran ko shabbar ko, khatun kayamat ko. Haidar ki kasam mazhar (Sarkare risalat ko) x2 Turbat me rulata hai, ye chaand muharram ka</span></font></div><div><font class=""Apple-style-span"" face=""Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"" size=""2""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  19px;"">(Sughra ko rulat hai, ye chaand muharram ka) x2</span></font></div></p>
                 
                